## Cheat Sheet

### Lab DSL Syntax

| Syntax                                             | Description                                  |
| -------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| `c4 do ... end`                                    | Define a C4 architecture model               |
| `customer = person("Customer")`                    | Declare an end-user / actor                  |
| `banking = system("Internet Banking", scope: :in)` | Declare in-scope or external software system |
| `api = container("API", parent: banking)`          | Declare a container inside a software system |
| `db = database("DB", parent: banking)`             | Declare a database container                 |
| `auth = component("Auth Service", parent: api)`    | Declare a component inside a container       |
| `scope banking` or `in_scope banking`              | Set the active scoped boundary for diagrams  |
| `boundary "Platform" do ... end`                   | Define an explicit boundary cluster          |

| `a ~> b |> uses("Calls API", technology: "HTTPS")`    | Piped relationship with label and technology        |
| `a ~> b \|> calls("Requests token")`                   | Piped calling relationship                          |
| `a ~> b \|> reads("Queries data", technology: "SQL")`  | Piped read relationship                             |
| `a ~> b \|> writes("Saves record")`                    | Piped write relationship                            |
| `a ~> b \|> sends("Emits event", technology: "Kafka")` | Piped event emission relationship                   |
| `a ~> b \|> on("label")`                               | Piped relationship label modifier                   |
| `a ~> b \|> technology("gRPC")`                        | Piped technology modifier                           |
| `edge a ~> b, "label", technology: "HTTPS"`           | Explicit edge declaration with options              |
| `system("App") do ... end`                            | Nested hierarchy block automatically setting parent |

### Programmatic Pipe API & Analysis

| Task / Feature                | Command                                                                         |
| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Create C4 Model               | `C4.new/1`                                                                      |
| Add Person                    | `C4.add_person/3` (Opts: `:label`, `:description`)                              |
| Add Software System           | `C4.add_software_system/3` (Opts: `:label`, `:description`, `:scope`)           |
| Add Container                 | `C4.add_container/3` (Opts: `:label`, `:technology`, `:description`, `:parent`) |
| Add Component                 | `C4.add_component/3` (Opts: `:label`, `:technology`, `:description`, `:parent`) |
| Add Relationship              | `C4.add_relationship/4` (Opts: `:label`, `:technology`)                         |
| Set Active Scope              | `C4.set_scope/2`                                                                |
| Get Active Scope              | `C4.scope/1`                                                                    |
| Query Model                   | `C4.nodes/1`, `C4.edges/1`, `C4.edges_with_meta/1`                              |
| L1 System Context View        | `Choreo.View.zoom(model, level: 0)`                                             |
| L2 Container View             | `Choreo.View.zoom(model, level: 1)`                                             |
| L3 Component View             | `Choreo.View.zoom(model, level: 2)`                                             |
| Focus Neighborhood View       | `Choreo.View.focus(model, node_id, radius: N)`                                  |
| Focus Between (Path View)     | `Choreo.View.focus_between(model, from_id, to_id)`                              |
| Render Mermaid                | `C4.to_mermaid/2` (Opts: `:theme`, `:direction`)                                |
| Render DOT Graphviz           | `C4.to_dot/2` (Opts: `:theme`, `:rankdir`)                                      |
| Validate Model Integrity      | `Analysis.validate/1` (Checks orphan nodes, missing parents/tech/descriptions)  |
| Missing Technology            | `Analysis.missing_technology/1`                                                 |
| Missing Descriptions          | `Analysis.missing_descriptions/1`                                               |
| Parents Without Relationships | `Analysis.parents_without_relationships/1`                                      |
